      "en": "In that day, there will be five cities in the land of Egypt that speak the language of Canaan, and swear to the LORD of Armies. One will be called “The city of destruction.”",
      "ko": "그 날에 애굽 땅에 가나안 방언을 말하며 만군의 여호와를 가리켜 맹세하는 다섯 성읍이 있을 것이며 그 중 하나를 장망성이라 칭하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "331debb5870bd0120336aa7d7bf8301a1ba56293be1f500cbbf087b06a33a49f",
      "translation_text_hash": "e5094efefac106180e305236a2336cd6e0e5f0495a33f3007858ce880222ab2c",
